{"id":57914,"date":"2026-08-08T15:17:03","date_gmt":"2026-08-08T14:17:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=57914"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:47:05","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:47:05","slug":"maratona-de-munique","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-munique\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Munique 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Munique 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Munique 2026<\/strong> (MARATHON M\u00dcNCHEN by Brooks) realiza-se no fim de semana de <strong>10 e 11 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> na capital da Baviera, na <strong>Alemanha<\/strong>. Com partida no <strong>Spiridon-Louis-Ring<\/strong> e consagra\u00e7\u00e3o na meta junto ao lago ol\u00edmpico em <strong>Willi-Daume-Platz<\/strong>, no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Parque Ol\u00edmpico de Munique (Olympiapark)<\/strong>, a m\u00edtica prova alem\u00e3 apresenta um tra\u00e7ado citadino renovado em volta \u00fanica de 42,195 km, certificado pela World Athletics e qualificador oficial para os Abbott World Marathon Majors.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O percurso atravessa as art\u00e9rias mais vibrantes de Munique, passando pelo <strong>Sendlinger Tor<\/strong>, <strong>Marienplatz<\/strong>, <strong>Siegestor<\/strong>, <strong>Odeonsplatz<\/strong>, o imenso <strong>Jardim Ingl\u00eas (Englischer Garten)<\/strong> e o din\u00e2mico bairro de <strong>Werksviertel<\/strong>. Al\u00e9m da maratona rainha e da estafeta a quatro (<strong>H\u00f6ffner Marathon Staffel<\/strong>), o programa inclui a concorrida <strong>Meia Maratona<\/strong>, a r\u00e1pida prova de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (com partida direta de Werksviertel-Mitte), o descontra\u00eddo <strong>Dallmayr Coffee Run<\/strong> e as corridas <strong>Kids Run<\/strong>. Prepara o teu treino, desafia os teus limites na Baviera e vive uma atmosfera atl\u00e9tica inesquec\u00edvel!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 e 11 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque Ol\u00edmpico (Olympiapark), Munique, Alemanha<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona (42 km), Meia Maratona (21 km), 10 km, Estafeta e Kids<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">MARATHON M\u00dcNCHEN GmbH<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/marathonmuenchen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/251107-MM26-Strecke-Marathon.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/><\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Maratona de Munique (42,195 Km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estafeta<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">H\u00f6ffner Estafeta da Maratona (4x)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:20<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Sport Schuster Meia Maratona (21 Km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:30<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">10 KM Run (Partida no Werksviertel)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 13:30<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Dallmayr Coffee Run (Shake-out Run)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Run (400m, 2,1 km e 4,2 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 13:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">5.00 \u20ac a 12.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de Munique 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Maratona de Munique realiza-se no domingo, 11 de Outubro de 2026, com partidas no Spiridon-Louis-Ring e chegada em Willi-Daume-Platz, no Parque Ol\u00edmpico (Olympiapark) de Munique, na Alemanha. As provas jovens e o shake-out run decorrem no s\u00e1bado, 10 de Outubro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os respetivos hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No domingo, 11 de Outubro, a Maratona (42,195 km) arranca \u00e0s 09:00, a Estafeta (Marathon Staffel) \u00e0s 09:20, a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) \u00e0s 10:30 no Olympiapark, e a corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 13:30 no Werksviertel-Mitte. No s\u00e1bado, 10 de Outubro, realizam-se o Dallmayr Coffee Run (5 km) \u00e0s 09:30 e a Kids Run (400m, 2,1 km e 4,2 km) a partir das 13:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) da Maratona e da Meia Maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite oficial para a Maratona de 42,195 km \u00e9 de 6 horas e 20 minutos, encerrando a meta \u00e0s 15:20. Na Meia Maratona, o tempo limite \u00e9 de 3 horas e 30 minutos (encerramento do controlo \u00e0s 14:00).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios se realiza o levantamento do dorsal (kit de atleta)?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do kit de participante e dorsal decorre na Olympiahalle (Parque Ol\u00edmpico de Munique) na sexta-feira (9 de Outubro) das 14:00 \u00e0s 18:00, no s\u00e1bado (10 de Outubro) das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00 e, excecionalmente para casos urgentes, no domingo das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:00, mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o com fotografia e confirma\u00e7\u00e3o de participa\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam os abastecimentos e o apoio aos atletas na meta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ao longo do percurso existem postos regulares de \u00e1gua e abastecimentos completos com bebidas isot\u00f3nicas, barras energ\u00e9ticas, g\u00e9is e fruta fresca a cada 2,5 a 5 km. Na meta, no Olympiapark, os participantes t\u00eam acesso a abastecimento p\u00f3s-meta (incluindo cerveja Paulaner sem \u00e1lcool), medalha de finalista, bengaleiro e balne\u00e1rios com duches gratuitos na Olympiaschwimmhalle.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Munique 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-10\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Munique, Alemanha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Alemanha\", \"addressRegion\": \"Alemanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"DE\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de Munique 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Maratona de Munique realiza-se no domingo, 11 de Outubro de 2026, com partidas no Spiridon-Louis-Ring e chegada em Willi-Daume-Platz, no Parque Ol\u00edmpico (Olympiapark) de Munique, na Alemanha. As provas jovens e o shake-out run decorrem no s\u00e1bado, 10 de Outubro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os respetivos hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No domingo, 11 de Outubro, a Maratona (42,195 km) arranca \u00e0s 09:00, a Estafeta (Marathon Staffel) \u00e0s 09:20, a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) \u00e0s 10:30 no Olympiapark, e a corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 13:30 no Werksviertel-Mitte. No s\u00e1bado, 10 de Outubro, realizam-se o Dallmayr Coffee Run (5 km) \u00e0s 09:30 e a Kids Run (400m, 2,1 km e 4,2 km) a partir das 13:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) da Maratona e da Meia Maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite oficial para a Maratona de 42,195 km \u00e9 de 6 horas e 20 minutos, encerrando a meta \u00e0s 15:20. Na Meia Maratona, o tempo limite \u00e9 de 3 horas e 30 minutos (encerramento do controlo \u00e0s 14:00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios se realiza o levantamento do dorsal (kit de atleta)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do kit de participante e dorsal decorre na Olympiahalle (Parque Ol\u00edmpico de Munique) na sexta-feira (9 de Outubro) das 14:00 \u00e0s 18:00, no s\u00e1bado (10 de Outubro) das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00 e, excecionalmente para casos urgentes, no domingo das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:00, mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o com fotografia e confirma\u00e7\u00e3o de participa\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam os abastecimentos e o apoio aos atletas na meta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ao longo do percurso existem postos regulares de \u00e1gua e abastecimentos completos com bebidas isot\u00f3nicas, barras energ\u00e9ticas, g\u00e9is e fruta fresca a cada 2,5 a 5 km. Na meta, no Olympiapark, os participantes t\u00eam acesso a abastecimento p\u00f3s-meta (incluindo cerveja Paulaner sem \u00e1lcool), medalha de finalista, bengaleiro e balne\u00e1rios com duches gratuitos na Olympiaschwimmhalle.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68638,